      "username": "trempelAE",
      "name": "Tadden Rempel",
      "created_at": "2026-02-18T19:12:33.291Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I recently added employees into our ERPNext system and on the projects screen I have been able to assign them timesheets, however I am not able to assign them tasks from the task screen. What do I need to do to be able to assign them tasks?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/trempelae/{size}/93938_2.png",
      "trust_level": 0,
